    "show_share": true,
    "description": "On December 13th 2022, a ceremony was held to formalise the gift from the alumni of the School of Nursing & Midwifery (SONAM) Class of 1983, to the Aga Khan University (AKU). The ceremony was held under the tree planted in 1981, by the Chancellor His Highness the Aga Khan, invoking a great sense of fondness and nostalgia for the alumni.",
